  "id": 205,
  "title": "IOC智控中心平台是什么？",
  "date": "2023-04-13",
  "summary": "IOC智控中心平台又称“数字孪生智慧运营中心”，简称IOC。是以数字孪生，AIoT物联网、大数据、云计算等技术为基础，打通园区各业务之间的信息壁垒，全面满足智慧园区建设需求的运营系统。",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-205.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2023-4-13/2023413192405678.png",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p style=\"line-height:3em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">IOC智控中心平台又称“</span><strong><span style=\"font-synthesis:style;font-weight:600;color:#121212;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">数字孪生智慧运营中心</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">”，</span><span style=\"color:#121212;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">简称IOC。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:3em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#121212;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">是以数字孪生，AIoT物联网、大数据、云计算等技术为基础，打通园区各业务之间的信息壁垒，全面满足智慧园区建设需求的运营系统。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:3em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#121212;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">纵观整个园区发展历程，园区系统不断围绕运营进行升级，从监控大屏到数字大屏，再到IOC指挥中心，背后逻辑都是让园区运营更高效，让园区所有环节都能被监测，实现风险可控、效率更优。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#121212;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-synthesis:style;font-weight:600;color:#121212;background-color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">真正好用的IOC解决3大痛点。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span></p><p data-pid=\"HcDFauek\" style=\"color:#121212;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"source han sans sc\", \"noto sans cjk sc\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", sans-serif;font-size:medium;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:1.4em;margin-bottom:1.4em;\"><span style=\"font-synthesis:style;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">&#183; 可视，</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">是所有数据都能进行呈现，招商的、运营的以及智慧服务数据。</span></p><p data-pid=\"ekRMdVYX\" style=\"color:#121212;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"source han sans sc\", \"noto sans cjk sc\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", sans-serif;font-size:medium;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:1.4em;margin-bottom:1.4em;\"><span style=\"font-synthesis:style;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">&#183; 可管，</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">则是所有指标成体系，各部门、员工客户等等范畴数据口径一致，能统一管理。</span></p><p data-pid=\"0BhGIA1l\" style=\"color:#121212;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"source han sans sc\", \"noto sans cjk sc\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", sans-serif;font-size:medium;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:1.4em;margin-bottom:1.4em;\"><span style=\"font-synthesis:style;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">&#183; 可控，</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">则是围绕业务，搭建完整的工具监测系统，能预警能控制，实现园区控制全覆盖。</span></p><p data-pid=\"0BhGIA1l\" style=\"color:#121212;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"source han sans sc\", \"noto sans cjk sc\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", sans-serif;font-size:medium;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:1.4em;margin-bottom:1.4em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\"><br /></span></p><p data-pid=\"qQzh_Y8L\" style=\"color:#121212;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"source han sans sc\", \"noto sans cjk sc\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", sans-serif;font-size:medium;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:1.4em;margin-bottom:1.4em;\"><span style=\"font-synthesis:style;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">IOC运营解决方案：</span></p><p data-pid=\"F81G2oPQ\" style=\"color:#121212;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"source han sans sc\", \"noto sans cjk sc\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", sans-serif;font-size:medium;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:1.4em;margin-bottom:1.4em;\"><span style=\"font-synthesis:style;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">1、数据打通——招商、运营、服务 数字指标全方位管控</span></p><p data-pid=\"hdG8fkzs\" style=\"color:#121212;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"source han sans sc\", \"noto sans cjk sc\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", sans-serif;font-size:medium;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:1.4em;margin-bottom:1.4em;\"><span style=\"font-synthesis:style;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">&#183; </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">招商阶段：对园区招商、租售、成交情况实时跟踪</span></p><p data-pid=\"SpZCezek\" style=\"color:#121212;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"source han sans sc\", \"noto sans cjk sc\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", sans-serif;font-size:medium;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:1.4em;margin-bottom:1.4em;\"><span style=\"font-synthesis:style;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">&#183; </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">服务阶段：对园区企业客户进行全维度分析跟踪</span></p><p data-pid=\"SpZCezek\" style=\"color:#121212;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"source han sans sc\", \"noto sans cjk sc\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", sans-serif;font-size:medium;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:1.4em;margin-bottom:1.4em;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">2</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体, simsun;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;\">管理分层——规划好高层、中层、基层管理视角</span></p><p data-pid=\"QqqN6XY5\" style=\"color:#121212;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"source han sans sc\", \"noto sans cjk sc\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", sans-serif;font-size:medium;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:1.4em;margin-bottom:1.4em;\"><span style=\"font-synthesis:style;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">&#183; </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">中层管理赋能：结合运营场景，数字化让业务管理方便高效</span></p><p data-pid=\"UcthVSj1\" style=\"color:#121212;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"source han sans sc\", \"noto sans cjk sc\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", sans-serif;font-size:medium;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:1.4em;margin-bottom:1.4em;\"><span style=\"font-synthesis:style;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">&#183; </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">高层管理赋能：实现全生命周期运营，数据真实、全面、关键，保障决策质量</span></p><p data-pid=\"86hlEau3\" style=\"color:#121212;font-family:-apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"source han sans sc\", \"noto sans cjk sc\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", sans-serif;font-size:medium;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:1.4em;margin-bottom:1.4em;\"><span style=\"font-synthesis:style;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">&#183; </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:宋体, simsun;\">组织考核：通过目标驱动考核、动态调整，调整建模数据，低成本快速刷新</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br /></span><br /></p>",
